$ factory doctor --worker --work-dir $TMP/work
exit 1
--- stdout
fail  git                    exec: "git": executable file not found in $PATH
        fix:                 install git in the worker image and put it on PATH
fail  agent CLI claude-code  harness not installed: "claude" was not found; install Claude Code (https://claude.com/claude-code) and make sure it is on PATH
        fix:                 install it and log in, or leave it out of --harnesses
fail  agent CLI grok         harness not installed: "grok" was not found; install the Grok CLI (https://x.ai/cli/install.sh) and make sure it is on PATH
        fix:                 install it and log in, or leave it out of --harnesses
pass  workspace writable     $TMP/work
--- stderr
factory doctor: 3 check(s) failed: git, agent CLI claude-code, agent CLI grok. Fix each as shown, then run 'factory doctor' again.
